OL,3,ATrump meeting Irish leader Micheal
OL,4,AMartin during visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is in Ireland
OL,7,Ffor a two-day visit.
OL,9,FHe has arrived at Farmleigh House, in
OL,10,FPhoenix Park, where he is meeting with
OL,11,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,12,FMicheal Martin.
OL,14,FTrump's first visit was to the Aras an
OL,15,FUachtarain - the official residence of
OL,16,Fthe Irish president - where he had a
OL,17,Fcourtesy call with Irish President
OL,18,FCatherine Connolly.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
