OL,3,ATrump meeting Irish leader Micheal
OL,4,AMartin during visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will also attend events at the US
OL,7,FAmbassador to Ireland's residence,
OL,8,Fbefore attending the Amgen Irish Open
OL,9,Fgolf tournament which is taking place
OL,10,Fat the Trump International Golf Links
OL,11,Fand Hotel Doonbeg in County Clare,
OL,12,Fwhich he owns.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
